{"completed": true, "response": "```json\n{\n  \"sec\": \"\",\n  \"mech\": \"\",\n  \"why\": \"没有。S04最接近的是M3，它确实描述了比第一次更尽兴的喜悦和满足后的安宁，但把“急切的盼望终于有了回应”当作解释依据，未能交代对方实际作出了什么回应，不能据此补出缺失的历史。M2、M20等候选可以解释更饱满的快乐或暂时安住的满足，却仍保留对共同拥有这份亲近的渴望或对方心意未知，不能独立证明24–34已经获得M33所要求的非常完整的满足。\"\n}\n```", "metadata": {"session_handle": "e1932267-bad2-4ddb-9304-a638be44f5a5", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261028T051714631227Z", "elapsed_seconds": 335.625, "completed_utc": "2026-10-28T05:22:50.274814+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "3521cb449e05974f625993eb6ed2fa43e05193f68a8d900d7fac097beca62acb", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude